    "title": "About Gotchipus",
    "about": "Long ago there was a world called Pharos, where the great lighthouse stood at its heart — kept alight by the Gotchipus, sentient octopus guardians, against the creeping darkness of the Abyss Rift. But the Rift finally split the world apart, and Pharos sank. A few Gotchipus survived. They carried the last embers of the lighthouse — small, glowing Beacons — across the deep, until they found new ground on Base. There they built a town, Lighthaven, and lit the Beacons one by one, calling their lost kin home. Light a Beacon. Summon a Gotchipus. Bind your soul. Help them rebuild Lighthaven, and stand watch against the dark that always returns.",
